# Trim docker build context — exclude large/irrelevant trees.

# vendored libs we don't need for Linux build (Linux uses system mupdf)
sioyek/mupdf/
sioyek/zlib/
sioyek/android/
sioyek/windows_runtime/

# macOS-only build outputs
sioyek/limn.app/
sioyek/sioyek.app/
sioyek/*.app/

# build artifacts that should be regenerated inside container
sioyek/*.o
sioyek/pdf_viewer/*.o
sioyek/moc_*.cpp
sioyek/moc_predefs.h
sioyek/qrc_resources.cpp
sioyek/Makefile

# logs / scratch
limn-repl.log
/tmp/

# git internals — NOT copied because the worktree's .git is a `gitdir:`
# pointer to a host abs path which doesn't exist inside the container.
# Build provenance comes in via --build-arg instead (see Dockerfile
# and scripts/build-docker.sh).
.git/
.gitignore

# direnv / build outputs (not needed inside container)
.envrc
result*
# flake.nix + flake.lock ARE needed (Dockerfile uses nix develop)

# editor / OS junk
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
